WEBVTT

00:00.820 --> 00:05.980
Hi, I'm Julian from Taylor Intelligence.
Most business owners know that AI can save

00:05.980 --> 00:10.920
them time, but they don't know what to
automate, what it would cost, or if it

00:10.920 --> 00:14.980
would even make a meaningful difference at
all. That's where our consultation comes

00:14.980 --> 00:18.940
in. We take a look at the work moving
through your business, all of the missed

00:18.940 --> 00:23.140
calls, the leads that may go cold, or
staff repeating the same repetitive tasks

00:23.140 --> 00:28.540
every day. We then create you a specific
automated plan. We'll show you what we can

00:28.540 --> 00:32.100
improve, we'll filter out what doesn't
need automation now, and we'll show you

00:32.100 --> 00:37.200
the impact that we can make. Leaving the
call, you will have a better understanding

00:37.200 --> 00:42.700
of how AI can help you in your business,
and that you won't have to deal with such

00:42.700 --> 00:45.240
technologies yourself if we can handle
them for you.

